# Copy to `.env.local`, then fill in from `make db-status`.
#
# `EXPO_PUBLIC_` is required for the value to be inlined into the client
# bundle. The anon key being public is correct and intentional: RLS is the
# tenant boundary, not client-side secrecy (see src/data/api.ts).
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54361
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=paste-anon-key-from-make-db-status
